[gd_scene format=3]

; ConvertTransformModifier3D: no visuals. Exercises setting_count and both
; two-segment leaf groups, apply/ and reference/, across all three transform
; modes: Position (0), Rotation (1) and Scale (2). Each mode selects a different
; PROPERTY_HINT_RANGE for the range_min/range_max pair beside it, so all three
; arms of that hint are covered.
; settings/0/apply_bone sits beside settings/0/apply/axis on purpose: one flat
; leaf and one nested group whose names share a prefix.
; settings/1 omits relative because its reference_type is Node, the state in
; which _validate_dynamic_prop clears that key to PROPERTY_USAGE_NONE.

